.jpg"},"img":"/blog/roll/personas-for-competitor-analysis.jpg","mailImg":"/blog/mail/personas-for-competitor-analysis.jpg"},"2":{"url":"ideal-customer-profile","blogImg":"/blog/ideal-customer-profile-sq.jpg","category":"Ideal customer profile","alt":"What Is an Ideal Customer Profile?","head":"What Is an Ideal Customer Profile?","desc":"Ideal Customer Profile (ICP) describes someone who would benefit a lot from what you offer and provides you with significant value in exchange. ICP helps you with meaningful conversations and sharper campaigns.","readTime":8,"related":[8,43,11],"meta":{"title":"What Is an Ideal Customer Profile? | Delve AI Blog","desc":"Ideal Customer Profile (ICP) describes someone who would benefit a lot from what you offer and provides you with significant value in exchange. Having an ICP helps you with meaningful conversations and sharper campaigns. Learn about ICP and how to keep it updated.","img":"/blog/ideal-customer-profile-sq.jpg"},"translation":{"nl":"428","fr":"429","he":"430","id":"431","it":"432","ja":"433","ko":"434","pt":"435","tr":"436","vi":"437","hi":"438","de":"439"},"img":"/blog/roll/ideal-customer-profile.jpg","mailImg":"/blog/mail/ideal-customer-profile.jpg","langNames":{"en":"English","nl":"Dutch","fr":"French","he":"Hebrew","id":"Indonesian","it":"Italian","ja":"Japanese","ko":"Korean","pt":"Portuguese","tr":"Turkish","vi":"Vietnamese","hi":"Hindi","de":"German"},"langUrls":{"en":"ideal-customer-profile","nl":"ideaal-klantprofiel","fr":"profil-client-ideal","he":"פרופיל-לקוח-אידיאלי","id":"profil-pelanggan-ideal","it":"profilo-cliente-ideale","ja":"理想的な-顧客-プロファイル","ko":"이상적인-고객-프로필","pt":"perfil-de-cliente-ideal","tr":"ideal-musteri-profili","vi":"ho-so-khach-hang-ly-tuong","hi":"आदर्श-ग्राहक-प्रोफाइल","de":"ideales-kundenprofil"}},"3":{"url":"buyer-persona","blogImg":"/blog/buyer-persona-sq.jpg","category":"Buyer personas","alt":"What Is a Buyer Persona and How to Create One?","head":"What Is a Buyer Persona?","desc":"A buye