ourney Transform the Customer Experience?","head":"AI Customer Journey","desc":"Here’s how AI customer journey transforms customer experiences across online and offline channels, giving marketers a more holistic view of their audience.","category":"Customer journeys","readTime":14,"related":[8,43,14],"meta":{"title":"Can AI Customer Journey Transform the Customer Experience?","img":"/blog/ai-customer-journey-sq.jpg"},"translation":{"nl":"120","es":"121","fr":"122","de":"123","hi":"124","id":"125","it":"126","pt":"127","vi":"128"},"img":"/blog/roll/ai-customer-journey.jpg","mailImg":"/blog/mail/ai-customer-journey.jpg","langNames":{"en":"English","nl":"Dutch","es":"Espanol","fr":"French","de":"German","hi":"Hindi","id":"Indonesian","it":"Italian","pt":"Portuguese","vi":"Vietnamese"},"langUrls":{"en":"ai-customer-journey","nl":"ai-klanttraject","es":"viaje-del-cliente-de-ia","fr":"parcours-client-ia","de":"ki-kundenreise","hi":"AI-ग्राहक-यात्रा","id":"perjalanan-pelanggan-ai","it":"viaggio-del-cliente-ai","pt":"jornada-do-cliente-de-ia","vi":"hanh-trinh-khach-hang-ai"}},"120":{"url":"ai-klanttraject","head":"Kunnen AI-klantreizen de klantervaring transformeren?","enCategory":"Buyer personas;Marketing AI","parent":"119","lang":"nl","desc":"Zo transformeren AI-klantreizen de klantervaring over online en offline kanalen, waardoor marketeers een holistischer beeld krijgen van hun doelgroep.","langNames":{"en":"English","nl":"Dutch","es":"Espanol","fr":"French","de":"German","hi":"Hindi","id":"Indonesian","it":"Italian","pt":"Portuguese","vi":"Vietnamese"},"langUrls":{"en":"ai-customer-journey","nl":"ai-klanttraject","es":"viaje-del-cliente-de-ia","fr":"parcours-client-ia","de":"ki-kundenreise","hi":"AI-ग्राहक-यात्रा","id":"perjalanan-pelanggan-ai","it":"viaggio-del-cliente-ai","pt":"jornada-do-cliente-de-ia","vi":"hanh-trinh-khach-hang-ai"}},"121":{"url":"viaje-del-cliente-de-ia","head":"¿Pueden los viajes del cliente de IA transformar la experiencia del cliente?","enCate