o":"마케팅을-위한-ai"},"meta":{"title":"16 casos de uso de IA en marketing","desc":"Aprende sobre las tendencias, los desafíos y la importancia de la inteligencia artificial (IA) en el marketing. La IA puede ayudar a reducir la duración de los ciclos de ventas, aumentar la tasa de retención y atraer más clientes."}},"154":{"url":"ia-pour-le-marketing","head":"16 cas d'utilisation de l'IA dans le marketing","enCategory":"Marketing AI;Persona use-cases","parent":"15","lang":"fr","desc":"Découvrez les tendances, les défis et l'importance de l'intelligence artificielle (IA) dans le marketing. L'IA peut aider à réduire la durée des cycles de vente, à augmenter le taux de rétention et à attirer plus de clients.","langNames":{"en":"English","nl":"Dutch","es":"Espanol","fr":"French","de":"German","hi":"Hindi","id":"Indonesian","it":"Italian","pt":"Portuguese","vi":"Vietnamese","ko":"Korean"},"langUrls":{"en":"ai-for-marketing","nl":"ai-voor-marketing","es":"ia-para-marketing","fr":"ia-pour-le-marketing","de":"ki-fur-marketing","hi":"मार्केटिंग-के-लिए-एआई","id":"ai-untuk-pemasaran","it":"ia-per-il-marketing","pt":"ia-em-marketing","vi":"ai-cho-marketing","ko":"마케팅을-위한-ai"},"meta":{"title":"16 cas d'utilisation de l'IA dans le marketing","desc":"Découvrez les tendances, les défis et l'importance de l'intelligence artificielle (IA) dans le marketing. L'IA peut aider à réduire la durée des cycles de vente, à augmenter le taux de rétention et à attirer plus de clients."}},"155":{"url":"ki-fur-marketing","head":"16 Anwendungsfälle von KI im Marketing","enCategory":"Marketing AI;Persona use-cases","parent":"15","lang":"de","desc":"Erfahren Sie mehr über Trends, Herausforderungen und die Bedeutung von Künstlicher Intelligenz (KI) im Marketing. KI kann dabei helfen, die Dauer von Vertriebszyklen zu verkürzen, die Kundenbindungsquote zu erhöhen und mehr Kunden zu gewinnen.","langNames":{"en":"English","nl":"Dutch","es":"Espanol","fr":"French","de":"German","hi":"Hindi","id":"Indonesian","it":"Italian","pt":"Portuguese","vi":"Vietnamese","ko":"Korean"},"langUrls":{"en":"ai-for-marketing","nl":"ai-voor-marketing","es":"ia-para-marketing","fr":"ia-pour-le-marketing","de":"ki-fur-marketing","hi":"मार्केटिंग-के-लिए-एआई","id":"ai-untuk-pemasaran","it":"ia-per-il-marketing","pt":"ia-em-marketing","vi":"ai-cho-marketing","ko":"마케팅을-위한-ai"}},"156":{"url":"मार्केटिंग-के-लिए-एआई","head":"मार्केटिंग में AI के 16 उपयोग","enCategory":"Marketing AI;Persona use-cases","parent":"15","lang":"hi","desc":"मार्केटिंग में कृत्रिम बुद्धिमत्ता (AI) के रुझानों, चुनौतियों और महत्व के बारे में जानें। AI विक्रय चक्रों की अवधि को कम करने, रिटेंशन दर को बढ़ाने और अधिक ग्राहक लाने में मदद कर सकता है।","langNames":{"en":"English","nl":"Dutch","es":"Espanol","fr":"French","de":"German","hi":"Hindi","id":"Indonesian","it":"Italian","pt":"Portuguese","vi":"Vietnamese","ko":"Korean"},"langUrls":{"en":"ai-for-marketing","nl":"ai-voor-marketing","es":"ia-para-marketing","fr":"ia-pour-le-marketing","de":"ki-fur-marketing","hi":"मार्केटिंग-के-लिए-एआई","id":"ai-untuk-pemasaran","it":"ia-per-il-marketing","pt":"ia-em-marketing","vi":"ai-cho-marketing","ko":"마케팅을-위한-ai"},"meta":{"title":"मार्केटिंग में AI के 16 उपयोग","desc":"मार्केटिंग में कृत्रिम बुद्धिमत्ता (AI) के रुझानों, चुनौतियों और महत्व के बारे में जानें। AI विक्रय चक्रों की अवधि को कम करने, रिटेंशन दर को बढ़ाने और अधिक ग्राहक लाने में मदद कर सकता है।"}},"157":{"url":"ai-untuk-pemasaran","head":"16 Kasus Penggunaan AI dalam Pemasaran","enCategory":"Marketing AI;Persona use-cases","parent":"15","lang":"id","desc":"Pelajari tentang tren, tantangan, dan pentingnya kecerdasan buatan (AI) dalam pemasaran. AI dapat membantu mengurangi panjangnya siklus penjualan, meningkatkan tingkat retensi, dan mendatangkan lebih banyak pelanggan.","langNames":{"en":"English","nl":"Dutch","es":"Espanol","fr":"French","de":"German","hi":"Hindi","id":"Indonesian","it":"Italian","pt":"Portuguese","vi":"Vietnamese","ko":"Korean"},"langUrls":{"en":"ai-for-mar