","vi":"Vietnamese","ko":"Korean"},"langUrls":{"en":"ai-for-marketing","nl":"ai-voor-marketing","es":"ia-para-marketing","fr":"ia-pour-le-marketing","de":"ki-fur-marketing","hi":"मार्केटिंग-के-लिए-एआई","id":"ai-untuk-pemasaran","it":"ia-per-il-marketing","pt":"ia-em-marketing","vi":"ai-cho-marketing","ko":"마케팅을-위한-ai"},"meta":{"title":"마케팅에서 AI의 16가지 사용 사례","desc":"마케팅에서 인공지능(AI)의 트렌드, 과제 및 중요성에 대해 알아보세요. AI는 영업 주기 길이를 줄이고, 고객 유지율을 높이며, 더 많은 고객을 유치하는 데 도움이 될 수 있습니다."}},"162":{"url":"meet-with-us-at-events","blogImg":"/blog/meet-with-us-at-events-sq.jpg","head":"Meet us at SaaStr, Inbound, DMWF & more","desc":"Join Delve AI at some of the most popular marketing events this Fall - SaaStr (SF Bay Area), Inbound (Boston), DMWF (New York) and SparkTogether (Seattle).","readTime":4,"category":"Events","img":"/blog/roll/meet-with-us-at-events.jpg","mailImg":"/blog/mail/meet-with-us-at-events.jpg"},"163":{"url":"create-personas-met-chatgpt","head":"Hoe Personas te Creëren met ChatGPT: Sjabloon Prompts, Tools en Voorbeelden","enCategory":"Marketing AI;Persona generation","parent":"62","lang":"nl","desc":"Een koper persona geeft je een idee over klantdoelen en motivaties. Leer hoe je ChatGPT kunt gebruiken om koper personas te creëren met sjabloon prompts, tools en voorbeelden.","langNames":{"en":"English","nl":"Dutch","es":"Espanol","fr":"French","de":"German","hi":"Hindi","id":"Indonesian","it":"Italian","pt":"Portuguese","vi":"Vietnamese","ko":"Korean"},"langUrls":{"en":"personas-chatgpt","nl":"create-personas-met-chatgpt","es":"crear-personas-con-chatgpt","fr":"creer-des-personas-avec-chatgpt","de":"erstellen-von-personas-mit-chatgpt","hi":"चैटजीपीटी-के-साथ-पर्सोना-बनाए","id":"buat-persona-dengan-chatgpt","it":"crea-persona-con-chatgpt","pt":"criar-personas-com-chatgpt","vi":"tao-personas-voi-chatgpt","ko":"chatgpt로-personas-만들기"}},"164":{"url":"crear-personas-con-chatgpt","head":"Cómo Crear Personas Usando ChatGPT: Plantillas de Indicaciones, Herramientas y Ejemplos","enCategory":"Marketing AI;Persona generation","parent":"62","lang":"es","desc":"Un persona de comprador te da una idea sobre los objetivos y motivaciones de los clientes. Aprende cómo usar ChatGPT para crear personas de comprador con plantillas de indicaciones, herramientas y ejemplos.","langNames":{"en":"English","nl":"Dutch","es":"Espanol","fr":"French","de":"German","hi":"Hindi","id":"Indonesian","it":"Italian","pt":"Portuguese","vi":"Vietnamese","ko":"Korean"},"langUrls":{"en":"personas-chatgpt","nl":"create-personas-met-chatgpt","es":"crear-personas-con-chatgpt","fr":"creer-des-personas-avec-chatgpt","de":"erstellen-von-personas-mit-chatgpt","hi":"चैटजीपीटी-के-साथ-पर्सोना-बनाए","id":"buat-persona-dengan-chatgpt","it":"crea-persona-con-chatgpt","pt":"criar-personas-com-chatgpt","vi":"tao-personas-voi-chatgpt","ko":"chatgpt로-personas-만들기"},"blogHead":"Cómo Crear Personas Usando ChatGPT: Plantillas de Indicaciones, Herramientas y Ejemplos"},"165":{"url":"creer-des-personas-avec-chatgpt","head":"Comment Créer des Personas en Utilisant ChatGPT : Modèles d'Invites, Outils et Exemples","enCategory":"Marketing AI;Persona generation","parent":"62","lang":"fr","desc":"Un persona d'acheteur vous donne une idée des objectifs et des motivations des clients. Apprenez à utiliser ChatGPT pour créer des personas d'acheteurs avec des modèles d'invites, des outils et des exemples.","langNames":{"en":"English","nl":"Dutch","es":"Espanol","fr":"French","de":"German","hi":"Hindi","id":"Indonesian","it":"Italian","pt":"Portuguese","vi":"Vietnamese","ko":"Korean"},"langUrls":{"en":"personas-chatgpt","nl":"create-personas-met-chatgpt","es":"crear-personas-con-chatgpt","fr":"creer-des-personas-avec-chatgpt","de":"erstellen-von-personas-mit-chatgpt","hi":"चैटजीपीटी-के-साथ-पर्सोना-बनाए","id":"buat-persona-dengan-chatgpt","it":"crea-persona-con-chatgpt","pt":"criar-personas-com-chatgpt","vi":"tao-personas-voi-chatgpt","ko":"chatgpt로-personas-만들기"},"blogHead":"Comment Créer des Personas en Utilisant ChatGPT : Modèles d'Invites, Outils et Exemples"},"166":{"url":"erstellen-von-personas-mit-chatgpt","head":"Wie Sie Personas mit ChatGPT erstellen: Vorlagen-Prompts, Tools und Beispiele","enCategory":"Marketing AI;Persona generation","parent":"62","lang":"de","desc":"Eine Käuferpersona gibt Ihnen eine Idee von den Zielen und Motivationen der Kunden. Erfahren Sie, wie Sie ChatGPT verwenden können, um Käuferpersona mit Vorlagen-Prompts, Tools und Beispielen zu erstellen.","langNames":{"en":"English","nl":"Dutch","es":"Espanol","fr":"French","de":"German","hi":"Hindi","id":"Indonesian","it":"Italian","pt":"Portuguese","vi":"Vietnamese","ko":"Korean"},"langUrls":{"en":"personas-chatgpt","nl":"create-personas-met-chatgpt","es":"crear-personas-con-chatgpt","fr":"creer-des-personas-avec-chatgpt","de":"erstellen-von-personas-mit-chatgpt","hi":"चैटजीपीटी-के-साथ-पर्सोना-बनाए","id":"buat-persona-dengan-chatgpt","it":"crea-persona-con-chatgpt","pt":"criar-personas-com-chatgpt","vi":"tao-personas-voi-chatgpt","ko":"chatgpt로-personas-만들기"}},"167":{"url":"चैटजीपीटी-के-साथ-पर्सोना-बनाए","head":"ChatGPT का उपयोग करके पर्सोना बनाना: टेम्पलेट प्रॉम्प्ट्स, उपकरण और उदाहरण","enCategory":"Marketing AI;Persona generation","parent":"62","lang":"hi","desc":"एक खरीदार पर्सोना आपको ग्राहक के लक्ष्यों और प्रेरणाओं के बारे में एक विचार देता है। टेम्पलेट प्रॉम्प्ट्स, उपकरण और उदाहरणों के साथ ChatGPT का उपयोग करके खरीदार पर्सोना कैसे बनाएं, सीखें।","langNames":{"en":"English","nl":"Dutch","es":"Espanol","fr":"French","de":"German","hi":"Hindi","id":"Indonesian","it":"Italian","pt":"Portuguese","vi":"Vietnamese","ko":"Korean"},"langUrls":{"en":"personas-chatgpt","nl":"create-personas-met-chatgpt","es":"crear-personas-con-chatgpt","fr":"creer-des-personas-avec-chatgpt","de":"erstellen-von-personas-mit-chatgpt","hi":"चैटजीपीटी-के-साथ-पर्सोना-बनाए","id":"buat-persona-dengan-chatgpt","it":"crea-persona-con-chatgpt","pt":"criar-personas-com-chatgpt","vi":"tao-personas-voi-chatgpt","ko":"chatgpt