 pour les réseaux sociaux. Utilisez des personas sociaux pour rédiger du contenu, préparer des stratégies, analyser les concurrents et interagir de manière cohérente.","langNames":{"en":"English","nl":"Dutch","es":"Espanol","fr":"French","de":"German","id":"Indonesian","it":"Italian","pt":"Portuguese","vi":"Vietnamese"},"langUrls":{"en":"social-media-personas","nl":"sociale-media-personas","es":"personas-de-redes-sociales","fr":"personas-des-reseaux-sociaux","de":"sozialpersona","id":"persona-media-sosial","it":"personas-dei-social-media","pt":"personas-das-redes-sociais","vi":"personas-mang-xa-hoi"},"meta":{"desc":"Apprenez à utiliser des insights sociaux riches pour créer vos personas d'acheteurs pour les réseaux sociaux. Utilisez des personas sociaux pour rédiger du contenu, préparer des stratégies, analyser les concurrents et interagir de manière cohérente."}},"266":{"url":"sozialpersona","head":"Wie man Social Media Personas erstellt","enCategory":"Social audience research;Persona generation","parent":"36","lang":"de","desc":"Lernen Sie, wie Sie umfangreiche soziale Erkenntnisse nutzen können, um Ihre Käuferpersonas für soziale Medien zu erstellen. Nutzen Sie Social-Personas zum Erstellen von Inhalten, zur Strategievorbereitung, Konkurrenzanalyse und für konsistente Interaktionen.","langNames":{"en":"English","nl":"Dutch","es":"Espanol","fr":"French","de":"German","id":"Indonesian","it":"Italian","pt":"Portuguese","vi":"Vietnamese"},"langUrls":{"en":"social-media-personas","nl":"sociale-media-personas","es":"personas-de-redes-sociales","fr":"personas-des-reseaux-sociaux","de":"sozialpersona","id":"persona-media-sosial","it":"personas-dei-social-media","pt":"personas-das-redes-sociais","vi":"personas-mang-xa-hoi"},"meta":{"desc":"Lernen Sie, wie Sie umfangreiche soziale Erkenntnisse nutzen können, um Ihre Käuferpersonas für soziale Medien zu erstellen. Nutzen Sie Social-Personas zum Erstellen von Inhalten, zur Strategievorbereitung, Konkurrenzanalyse und für konsistente Interaktionen."}},"267":{"url":"persona-media-sosial","head":"Cara Membuat Persona Media Sosial","enCategory":"Social audience research;Persona generation","parent":"36","lang":"id","desc":"Pelajari cara menggunakan wawasan sosial yang kaya untuk membuat persona pembeli Anda di media sosial. Gunakan persona sosial untuk menyusun konten, mempersiapkan strategi, menganalisis pesaing dan berinteraksi secara konsisten.","langNames":{"en":"English","nl":"Dutch","es":"Espanol","fr":"French","de":"German","id":"Indonesian","it":"Italian","pt":"Portuguese","vi":"Vietnamese"},"langUrls":{"en":"social-media-personas","nl":"sociale-media-personas","es":"personas-de-redes-sociales","fr":"personas-des-reseaux-sociaux","de":"sozialpersona","id":"persona-media-sosial","it":"personas-dei-social-media","pt":"personas-das-redes-sociais","vi":"personas-mang-xa-hoi"}},"268":{"url":"personas-dei-social-media","head":"Come Creare Personas per i Social Media","enCategory":"Social audience research;Persona generation","parent":"36","lang":"it","desc":"Impara a utilizzare ricchi insight sociali per creare le tue personas degli acquirenti per i social media. Usa le personas social per creare contenuti, preparare strategie, analizzare i concorrenti e interagire in modo coerente.","langNames":{"en":"English","nl":"Dutch","es":"Espanol","fr":"French","de":"German","id":"Indonesian","it":"Italian","pt":"Portuguese","vi":"Vietnamese"},"langUrls":{"en":"social-media-personas","nl":"sociale-media-personas","es":"personas-de-redes-sociales","fr":"personas-des-reseaux-sociaux","de":"sozialpersona","id":"persona-media-sosial","it":"personas-dei-social-media","pt":"personas-das-redes-sociais","vi":"personas-mang-xa-hoi"}},"269":{"url":"personas-das-redes-sociais","head":"Como Criar Personas para Redes Sociais","enCategory":"Social audience research;Persona generation","parent":"36","lang":"pt","desc":"Aprenda a usar insights sociais ricos para criar suas personas de compradores para redes sociais. Use personas sociais para redigir conteúdo, preparar estratégias, analisar concorrentes e interagir de forma consistente.","langNames":{"en":"English","nl":"Dutch","es":"Espanol","fr":"French","de":"German","id":"Indonesian","it":"Italian","pt":"Portuguese","vi":"Vietnamese"},"langUrls":{"en":"social-media-personas","nl":"sociale-media-personas","es":"personas-de-redes-sociales","fr":"personas-des-reseaux-sociaux","de":"sozialpersona","id":"persona-media-sosial","it":"personas-dei-social-media","pt":"personas-das-redes-sociais","vi":"personas-mang-xa-hoi"}},"270":{"url":"personas-mang-xa-hoi","head":"Cách Tạo Personas Trên Mạng Xã Hội","enCategory":"Social audience research;Persona generation","parent":"36","lang":"vi","desc":"Tìm hiểu cách sử dụng các hiểu biết phong phú về mạng xã hội để tạo personas người mua của bạn. Sử dụng personas mạng xã hội để soạn nội dung, chuẩn bị chiến lược, phân tích đối thủ cạnh tranh và tương tác một cách nhất quán.","langNames":{"en":"English","nl":"Dutch","es":"Espanol","fr":"French","de":"German","id":"Indonesian","it":"Italian","pt":"Portuguese","vi":"Vietnamese"},"langUrls":{"en":"social-media-personas","nl":"sociale-media-personas","es":"personas-de-redes-sociales","fr":"personas-des-reseaux-sociaux","de":"sozialpersona","id":"persona-media-sosial","it":"personas-dei-social-media","pt":"personas-das-redes-sociais","vi":"personas-mang-xa-hoi"}},"271":{"url":"بيرسونا-منشأة-بالذكاء-الاصطناعي","head":"شخصية مولدة بالذكاء الاصطناعي: كيفية إنشاء شخصيات باستخدام الذكاء الاصطناعي","enCategory":"Marketing AI;Buyer personas;Persona generation","parent":"12","lang":"ar","desc":"تساعدك الشخصيات المولدة بالذكاء الاصطناعي في تطوير شخصيات ملائمة وحديثة بطريقة آلية. وهي ضرورية في عصر سلوك المستهلك سريع التغير الذي يولد بيانات مستخدم هائلة.","langNames":{"en":"English","es":"Espanol","fr":"French","it":"Italian","id":"Indonesian","vi":"Vietnamese","hi":"Hindi","nl":"Dutch","de":"German","pt":"Portuguese","ar":"Arabic","he":"Hebrew","ja":"Japanese","ko":"Korean","zh":"Chinese","tr":"Turkish"},"langUrls":{"en":"ai-generated-persona","es":"persona-generada-por-la-ia","fr":"personnage-genere-par-l-ia","it":"persona-generata-dall-ai","id":"ai-menghasilkan-persona","vi":"ai-tao-ra-nhan-cach","hi":"ai-जनरेटेड-पर्सोना","nl":"ki-gegenereerde-persona","de":"ki-generierte-persona","pt":"persona-gerada-por-ia","ar":"بيرسونا-منشأة-بالذكاء-الاصطناعي","he":"פרסונה-שנוצרה-על-ידי-בינה-מלאכותית","ja":"ai生成ペルソナ","ko":"ai-생성-persona","zh":"ai生成-persona","tr":"ai-uretimli-persona"},"blogHead":"شخصية مولدة بالذكاء الاصطناعي: كيفية إنشاء شخصيات باستخدام الذكاء الاصطناعي","meta":{"title":"شخصية مولدة بالذكاء الاصطناعي: كيفية إنشاء شخصيات باستخدام الذكاء الاصطناعي","desc":"تساعدك الشخصيات المولدة بالذكاء الاصطناعي في تطوير شخصيات ملائمة وحديثة بطريقة آلية. وهي ضرورية في عصر سلوك المستهلك سريع التغير الذي يولد بيانات مستخدم هائلة."}},"272":{"url":"פרסונה-שנוצרה-על-ידי-בינה-מלאכותית","head":"דמות שנוצרה על ידי בינה מלאכותית: כיצד ליצור דמויות עם בינה מלאכותית","enCategory":"Marketing AI;Buyer personas;Persona generation","parent":"12","lang":"he","desc":"דמויות שנוצרו על ידי בינה מלאכותית מסייעות לך לפתח דמויות רלוונטיות ועדכניות באופן אוטומטי. הן קריטיות בעידן של התנהגות צרכנים המשתנה במהירות ומייצרת נתוני משתמש עצומים.","langNames":{"en":"English","es":"Espanol","fr":"French","it":"Italian","id":"Indonesian","vi":"Vietnamese","hi":"Hindi","nl":"Dutch","de":"German","pt":"Portuguese","ar":"Arabic","he":"Hebrew","ja":"Japanese","ko":"Korean","zh":"Chinese","tr":"Turkish"},"langUrls":{"en":"ai-generated-persona","es":"persona-generada-por-la-ia","fr":"personnage-genere-par-l-ia","it":"persona-generata-dall-ai","id":"ai-menghasilkan-persona","vi":"ai-tao-ra-nhan-cach","hi":"ai-जनरेटेड-पर्सोना","nl":"ki-gegenereerde-persona","de":"ki-generierte-persona","pt":"persona-gerada-por-ia","ar":"بيرسونا-منشأة-بالذكاء-الاصطناعي","he":"פרסונה-שנוצרה-על-ידי-בינה-מלאכותית","ja":"ai生成ペルソナ","ko":"ai-생성-persona","zh":"ai生成-persona","tr":"ai-uretimli-persona"}},"273":{"url":"ai生成ペルソナ","head":"AI生成ペルソナ：AIでペルソナを作成する方法","enCategory":"Marketing AI;Buyer personas;Persona generation","parent":"12","lang":"ja","desc":"AI生成ペルソナは、自動化された方法で関連性の高い最新のペルソナを開発するのに役立ちます。膨大なユーザーデータを生成する急速に変化する消費者行動の時代において重要です。","langNames":{"en":"English","es":"Espanol","fr":"French","it":"Italian","id":"Indonesian","vi":"Vietnamese","hi":"Hindi","nl":"Dutch","de":"German","pt":"Portuguese","ar":"Arabic","he":"Hebrew","ja":"Japanese","ko":"Korean","zh":"Chinese","tr":"Turkish"},"langUrls":{"en":"ai-generated-persona","es":"persona-generada-por-la-ia","fr":"personnage-genere-par-l-ia","it":"persona-generata-dall-ai","id":"ai-menghasilkan-persona","vi":"ai-tao-ra-nhan-cach","hi":"ai-जनरेटेड-पर्सोना","nl":"ki-gegenereerde-persona","de":"ki-generierte-persona","pt":"persona-gerada-por-ia","ar":"بيرسونا-منشأة-بالذكاء-الاصطناعي","he":"פרסונה-שנוצרה-על-ידי-בינה-מלאכותית","ja":"ai生成ペルソナ","ko":"ai-생성-persona","zh":"ai生成-persona","tr":"ai-uretimli-persona"}},"274":{"url":"ai-생성-persona","head":"AI 생성 페르소나: AI로 페르소나를 만드는 방법","enCategory":"Marketing AI;Buyer personas;Persona generation","parent":"12","lang":"ko","desc":"AI 생성 페르소나는 자동화된 방식으로 관련성 있고 최신의 페르소나를 개발하는 데 도움을 줍니다. 이는 방대한 사용자 데이터를 생성하는 빠르게 변화하는 소비자 행동의 시대에 매우 중요합니다.","langNames":{"en":"English","es":"Espanol","fr":"French","it":"Italian","id":"Indonesian","vi":"Vietnamese","hi":"Hindi","nl":"Dutch","de":"German","pt":"Portuguese","ar":"Arabic","he":"Hebrew","ja":"Japanese","ko":"Korean","zh":"Chinese","tr":"Turkish"},"langUrls":{"en":"ai-generated-persona","es":"persona-generada-por-la-ia","fr":"personnage-genere-par-l-ia","it":"persona-generata-dall-ai","id":"ai-menghasilkan-persona","vi":"ai-tao-ra-nhan-cach","hi":"ai-जनरेटेड-पर्सोना","nl":"ki-gegenereerde-persona","de":"ki-generierte-persona","pt":"persona-gerada-por-ia","ar":"بيرسونا-منشأة-بالذكاء-الاصطناعي","he":"פרסונה-שנוצרה-על-ידי-בינה-מלאכותית","ja":"ai生成ペルソナ","ko":"ai-생성-persona","zh":"ai生成-persona","tr":"ai-uretimli-persona"}},"27