arketing segmentation","parent":"66","lang":"vi","desc":"Phân tích cảm xúc là quá trình phát hiện cảm xúc của người tiêu dùng với sự hỗ trợ của công nghệ AI và học máy. Tìm hiểu thêm về cách nó có thể giúp bạn đưa ra quyết định kinh doanh sáng suốt.","langNames":{"en":"English","zh":"Chinese","nl":"Dutch","es":"Espanol","fr":"French","de":"German","he":"Hebrew","id":"Indonesian","it":"Italian","ko":"Korean","pt":"Portuguese","tr":"Turkish","vi":"Vietnamese"},"langUrls":{"en":"emotion-analysis","zh":"情绪分析","nl":"emotie-analyse","es":"analisis-emociones","fr":"analyse-emotions","de":"emotionsanalyse","he":"ניתוח-רגשות","id":"analisis-emosi","it":"analisi-emozioni","ko":"감정-분석","pt":"analise-emocoes","tr":"duygu-analizi","vi":"phan-tich-cam-xuc"},"blogHead":"Phân Tích Cảm Xúc: Định Nghĩa, Mô Hình và Trường Hợp Sử Dụng"},"295":{"url":"التقسيم-التكنوغرافي","head":"ما هو التقسيم التكنوغرافي ولماذا يهم؟","enCategory":"Marketing segmentation","parent":"58","lang":"ar","desc":"يقسم التقسيم التكنوغرافي عملاءك على أساس استخدامهم للتكنولوجيا ومعدلات تبنيهم لها. تعرف على كيفية تعزيز جهود التسويق بين الشركات وتحفيز نمو العملاء.","langNames":{"en":"English","ar":"Arabic","zh":"Chinese","nl":"Dutch","es":"Espanol","fr":"French","de":"German","he":"Hebrew","hi":"Hindi","id":"Indonesian","it":"Italian","ja":"Japanese","ko":"Korean","pt":"Portuguese","tr":"Turkish","vi":"Vietnamese"},"langUrls":{"en":"technographic-segmentation","ar":"التقسيم-التكنوغرافي","zh":"技术统计细分","nl":"technografische-segmentatie","es":"segmentacion-tecnografica","fr":"segmentation-technographique","de":"technografische-segmentierung","he":"סגמנטציה-טכנוגרפית","hi":"टेक्नोग्राफिक-सेगमेटेशन","id":"segmentasi-teknografis","it":"segmentazione-tecnografica","ja":"テクノグラフィック-セグメンテーション","ko":"기술통계-세분화","pt":"segmentacao-tecnografica","tr":"teknografik-segmentasyon","vi":"phan-khuc-technographic"}},"296":{"url":"技术统计细分","head":"什么是技术统计细分，为什么它很重要？","enCategory":"Marketing segmentation","parent":"58","lang":"zh","desc":"技术统计细分根据客户的技术使用情况和采用率来划分客户群。了解它如何提升您的B2B营销效果并推动客户增长。","langNames":{"en":"English","ar":"Arabic","zh":"Chinese","nl":"Dutch","es":"Espanol","fr":"French","de":"German","he":"Hebrew","hi":"Hindi","id":"Indonesian","it":"Italian","ja":"Japanese","ko":"Korean","pt":"Portuguese","tr":"Turkish","vi":"Vietnamese"},"langUrls":{"en":"technographic-segmentation","ar":"التقسيم-التكنوغرافي","zh":"技术统计细分","nl":"technografische-segmentatie","es":"segmentacion-tecnografica","fr":"segmentation-technographique","de":"technografische-segmentierung","he":"סגמנטציה-טכנוגרפית","hi":"टेक्नोग्राफिक-सेगमेटेशन","id":"segmentasi-teknografis","it":"segmentazione-tecnografica","ja":"テクノグラフィック-セグメンテーション","ko":"기술통계-세분화","pt":"segmentacao-tecnografica","tr":"teknografik-segmentasyon","vi":"phan-khuc-technographic"}},"297":{"url":"technografische-segmentatie","head":"Wat is Technografische Segmentatie en Waarom is het Belangrijk?","enCategory":"Marketing segmentation","parent":"58","lang":"nl","desc":"Technografische segmentatie verdeelt uw klanten op basis van hun technologiegebruik en adoptiegraad. Ontdek hoe het uw B2B-marketinginspanningen kan verbeteren en klantengroei kan stimuleren.","langNames":{"en":"English","ar":"Arabic","zh":"Chinese","nl":"Dutch","es":"Espanol","fr":"French","de":"German","he":"Hebrew","hi":"Hindi","id":"Indonesian","it":"Italian","ja":"Japanese","ko":"Korean","pt":"Portuguese","tr":"Turkish","vi":"Vietnamese"},"langUrls":{"en":"technographic-segmentation","ar":"التقسيم-التكنوغرافي","zh":"技术统计细分","nl":"technografische-segmentatie","es":"segmentacion-tecnografica","fr":"segmentation-technographique","de":"technografische-segmentierung","he":"סגמנטציה-טכנוגרפית","hi":"टेक्नोग्राफिक-सेगमेटेशन","id":"segmentasi-teknografis","it":"segmentazione-tecnografica","ja":"テクノグラフィック-セグメンテーション","ko":"기술통계-세분화","pt":"segmentacao-tecnografica","tr":"teknografik-segmentasyon","vi":"phan-khuc-technographic"}},"298":{"url":"segmentacion-tecnografica","head":"¿Qué es la Segmentación Tecnográfica y Por Qué es Importante?","enCategory":"Marketing segmentation","parent":"58","lang":"es","desc":"La segmentación tecnográfica divide a tus clientes según su uso de tecnología y tasas de adopción. Aprende cómo puede impulsar tus esfuerzos de marketing B2B y aumentar el crecimiento de clientes.","langNames":{"en":"English","ar":"Arabic","zh":"Chinese","nl":"Dutch","es":"Espanol","fr":"French","de":"German","he":"Hebrew","hi":"Hindi","id":"Indonesian","it":"Italian","ja":"Japanese","ko":"Korean","pt":"Portuguese","tr":"Turkish","vi":"Vietnamese"},"langUrls":{"en":"technographic-segmentation","ar":"التقسيم-التكنوغرافي","zh":"技术统计细分","nl":"technografische-segmentatie","es":"segmentacion-tecnografica","fr":"segmentation-technographique","de":"technografische-segmentierung","he":"סגמנטציה-טכנוגרפית","hi":"टेक्नोग्राफिक-सेगमेटेशन","id":"segmentasi-teknografis","it":"segmentazione-tecnografica","ja":"テクノグラフィック-セグメンテーション","ko":"기술통계-세분화","pt":"segmentacao-tecnografica","tr":"teknografik-segmentasyon","vi":"phan-khuc-technographic"},"blogHead":"¿Qué es la Segmentación Tecnográfica y Por Qué es Importante?"},"299":{"url":"segmentation-technographique","head":"Qu'est-ce que la Segmentation Technographique et Pourquoi est-elle Importante ?","enCategory":"Marketing segmentation","parent":"58","lang":"fr","desc":"La segmentation technographique divise vos clients selon leur utilisation de la technologie et leurs taux d'adoption. Découvrez comment elle peut améliorer vos efforts marketing B2B et stimuler la croissance client.","langNames":{"en":"English","ar":"Arabic","zh":"Chinese","nl":"Dutch","es":"Espanol","fr":"French","de":"German","he":"Hebrew","hi":"Hindi","id":"Indonesian","it":"Italian","ja":"Japanese","ko":"Korean","pt":"Portuguese","tr":"Turkish","vi":"Vietnamese"},"langUrls":{"en":"technographic-segmentation","ar":"التقسيم-التكنوغرافي","zh":"技术统计细分","nl":"technografische-segmentatie","es":"segmentacion-tecnografica","fr":"segmentation-technographique","de":"tec