agramペルソナ","ko":"인스타그램-페르소나","pt":"persona-do-instagram","tr":"instagram-persona-olusturma","vi":"persona-instagram-tao"}},"315":{"url":"persona-instagram","head":"Comment générer vos Personas Instagram","enCategory":"Social audience research;Persona generation","parent":"38","lang":"fr","desc":"Dans cet article, nous examinons comment générer vos personas utilisateurs Instagram. Utilisez-les, avec votre persona de marque, pour être pertinent et attractif pour votre public cible","langNames":{"en":"English","ar":"Arabic","zh":"Chinese","nl":"Dutch","es":"Espanol","fr":"French","de":"German","he":"Hebrew","hi":"Hindi","id":"Indonesian","it":"Italian","ja":"Japanese","ko":"Korean","pt":"Portuguese","tr":"Turkish","vi":"Vietnamese"},"langUrls":{"en":"instagram-personas","ar":"بيرسونا-انستغرام","zh":"instagram佩尔索纳","nl":"instagram-personas-genereren","es":"persona-de-instagram","fr":"persona-instagram","de":"instagram-personas-erstellen","he":"פרסונת-אינסטגרם","hi":"इस्टाग्राम-पर्सोना","id":"membuat-persona-instagram","it":"personas-instagram-generare","ja":"instagramペルソナ","ko":"인스타그램-페르소나","pt":"persona-do-instagram","tr":"instagram-persona-olusturma","vi":"persona-instagram-tao"}},"316":{"url":"instagram-personas-erstellen","head":"Wie man Instagram-Personas erstellt","enCategory":"Social audience research;Persona generation","parent":"38","lang":"de","desc":"In diesem Artikel schauen wir uns an, wie Sie Ihre Instagram-Nutzerpersonas erstellen können. Nutzen Sie sie zusammen mit Ihrer Markenpersona, um für Ihre Zielgruppe relevant und attraktiv zu sein","langNames":{"en":"English","ar":"Arabic","zh":"Chinese","nl":"Dutch","es":"Espanol","fr":"French","de":"German","he":"Hebrew","hi":"Hindi","id":"Indonesian","it":"Italian","ja":"Japanese","ko":"Korean","pt":"Portuguese","tr":"Turkish","vi":"Vietnamese"},"langUrls":{"en":"instagram-personas","ar":"بيرسونا-انستغرام","zh":"instagram佩尔索纳","nl":"instagram-personas-genereren","es":"persona-de-instagram","fr":"persona-instag