oyee retention strategies with examples of programs and plans that retain top talent. Use them to boost employee satisfaction at the workplace and reduce turnover.","category":"HR Personas","readTime":11,"related":[230,253,232],"meta":{"title":"Employee Retention: Examples and Strategies in 2025","img":"/blog/employee-retention-strategies-sq.jpg"},"img":"/blog/roll/employee-retention-strategies.jpg","mailImg":"/blog/mail/employee-retention-strategies.jpg"},"327":{"url":"target-audience","blogImg":"/blog/target-audience-sq.jpg","alt":"How to Find Your Target Audience: Types & Examples","blogHead":"How to Find Your Target Audience: Types & Examples","head":"How to Find Your Target Audience","desc":"A well-defined target audience helps brands fine-tune their marketing strategy to achieve maximum customer reach and engagement in the most cost-effective way.","category":"Marketing segmentation;Market research","readTime":12,"related":[3,17,42],"meta":{"title":"How to Find Your Target Audience: Types & Examples","img":"/blog/target-audience-sq.jpg"},"img":"/blog/roll/target-audience.jpg","mailImg":"/blog/mail/target-audience.jpg"},"328":{"url":"merk-persoonlijkheid","head":"Waarom Merkpersoonlijkheid Belangrijk is: Definitie, Eigenschappen en Voorbeelden","enCategory":"Marketing segmentation","parent":"64","lang":"nl","desc":"Merkpersoonlijkheid is de verzameling menselijke eigenschappen die we associëren met merken. Ontdek waarom het belangrijk is met voorbeelden en hoe je er een kunt creëren voor jouw merk die opvalt en je publiek versteld doet staan.","langNames":{"en":"English","nl":"Dutch","de":"German","id":"Indonesian","pt":"Portuguese","vi":"Vietnamese","ja":"Japanese"},"langUrls":{"en":"brand-personality","nl":"merk-persoonlijkheid","de":"marken-persoenlichkeit","id":"kepribadian-merek","pt":"personalidade-da-marca","vi":"tinh-cach-thuong-hieu","ja":"ブランドパーソナリティ"}},"329":{"url":"marken-persoenlichkeit","head":"Warum Markenpersönlichkeit wichtig ist: Definition, Eigenschaften und Beispiele","enCategory":"Marketing segmentation","parent":"64","lang":"de","desc":"Markenpersönlichkeit ist die Gesamtheit menschlicher Eigenschaften, die wir mit Marken verbinden. Erfahren Sie anhand von Beispielen, warum sie wichtig ist und wie Sie eine für Ihre Marke erstellen, die sich von der Masse abhebt und Ihr Publikum begeistert.","langNames":{"en":"English","nl":"Dutch","de":"German","id":"Indonesian","pt":"Portuguese","vi":"Vietnamese","ja":"Japanese"},"langUrls":{"en":"brand-personality","nl":"merk-persoonlijkheid","de":"marken-persoenlichkeit","id":"kepribadian-merek","pt":"personalidade-da-marca","vi":"tinh-cach-thuong-hieu","ja":"ブランドパーソナリティ"}},"330":{"url":"kepribadian-merek","head":"Mengapa Kepribadian Merek Penting: Definisi, Sifat dan Contoh","enCategory":"Marketing segmentation","parent":"64","lang":"id","desc":"Kepribadian merek adalah kumpulan sifat manusia yang kita asosiasikan dengan merek. Pelajari mengapa hal ini penting dengan contoh dan cara menciptakan kepribadian untuk merek Anda yang menonjol dari keramaian dan memukau audiens Anda.","langNames":{"en":"English","nl":"Dutch","de":"German","id":"Indonesian","pt":"Portuguese","vi":"Vietnamese","ja":"Japanese"},"langUrls":{"en":"brand-personality","nl":"merk-persoonlijkheid","de":"marken-persoenlichkeit","id":"kepribadian-merek","pt":"personalidade-da-marca","vi":"tinh-cach-thuong-hieu","ja":"ブランドパーソナリティ"}},"331":{"url":"ブランドパーソナリティ","head":"ブランドパーソナリティが重要な理由：定義、特性、例","enCategory":"Marketing segmentation","parent":"64","lang":"ja","desc":"ブランドパーソナリティとは、私たちがブランドに関連付ける人間的特性の集合です。例を通じてその重要性を学び、群衆の中から際立ち、観客を魅了するブランドの作り方を習得しましょう。","langNames":{"en":"English","nl":"Dutch","de":"German","id":"Indonesian","pt":"Portuguese","vi":"Vietnamese","ja":"Japanese"},"langUrls":{"en":"brand-personality","nl":"merk-persoonlijkheid","de":"marken-persoenlichkeit","id":"kepribadian-merek","pt":"personalidade-da-marca","vi":"tinh-cach-thuong-hieu","ja":"ブランドパーソナリティ"}},"332":{"url":"personalidade-da-marca","head":"Por que a Personalidade da Marca Importa: Definição, Características e Exemplos","enCategory":"Marketing segmentation","parent":"64","lang":"pt","desc":"Personalidade da marca é o conjunto de traços humanos que associamos às marcas. Aprenda por que isso é importante com exemplos e como criar uma para sua marca que se destaque da multidão e encante seu público.","langNames":{"en":"English","nl":"Dutch","de":"German","id":"Indonesian","pt":"Portuguese","vi":"Vietnamese","ja":"Japanese"},"langUrls":{"en":"brand-personality","nl":"merk-persoonlijkheid","de":"marken-persoenlichkeit","id":"kepribadian-merek","pt":"personalidade-da-marca","vi":"tinh-cach-thuong-hieu","ja":"ブランドパーソナリティ"}},"333":{"url":"tinh-cach-thuong-hieu","head":"Tại sao Tính cách Thương hiệu Quan trọng: Định nghĩa, Đặc điểm và Ví dụ","enCategory":"Marketing segmentation","parent":"64","lang":"vi","desc":"Tính cách thương hiệu là tập hợp các đặc điểm con người mà chúng ta gắn liền với thương hiệu. Tìm hiểu tại sao nó quan trọng thông qua các ví dụ và cách tạo ra một tính cách cho thương hiệu của bạn nổi bật giữa đám đông và thu hút khán giả.","langNames":{"en":"English","nl":"Dutch","de":"German","id":"Indonesian","pt":"Portuguese","vi":"Vietnamese","ja":"Japanese"},"langUrls":{"en":"brand-personality","nl":"merk-persoonlijkheid","de":"marken-persoenlichkeit","id":"kepribadian-merek","pt":"personalidade-da-marca","vi":"tinh-cach-thuong-hieu","ja":"ブランドパーソナリティ"}},"334":{"url":"إحصائيات-شخصية-المشتري","head":"+50 إحصائية عن بيرسونا المشتري تظهر فعاليتها","enCategory":"Buyer personas","parent":"49","lang":"ar","desc":"تحقق من إحصائيات بيرسونا المشتري التي تظهر فعاليتها في التسويق والمبيعات. استخدم بيرسونا المشتري لتحسين القيمة المقترحة وتطوير استراتيجيات عمل فعالة.","langNames":{"en":"English","ar":"Arabic","zh":"Chinese","nl":"Dutch","es":"Espanol","fr":"French","de":"German","he":"Hebrew","hi":"Hindi","id":"Indonesian","it":"Italian","ja":"Japanese","ko":"Korean","pt":"Portuguese","tr":