-persona","he":"פרסונה-עובדים","hi":"कर्मचारी-पर्सोना","id":"persona-karyawan","it":"persona-dipendente","ja":"従業員-ペルソナ","pt":"persona-funcionario","tr":"calisan-persona","vi":"persona-nhan-vien"}},"360":{"url":"员工-佩尔索纳","head":"什么是员工佩尔索纳？定义、好处和用途","enCategory":"HR Personas","parent":"59","lang":"zh","desc":"员工佩尔索纳代表具有共同特征的员工群体。它们帮助你创造积极的工作文化。","langNames":{"en":"English","ar":"Arabic","zh":"Chinese","nl":"Dutch","es":"Espanol","fr":"French","de":"German","he":"Hebrew","hi":"Hindi","id":"Indonesian","it":"Italian","ja":"Japanese","pt":"Portuguese","tr":"Turkish","vi":"Vietnamese"},"langUrls":{"en":"employee-personas","ar":"بيرسونا-الموظفين","zh":"员工-佩尔索纳","nl":"werknemers-persona","es":"persona-empleado","fr":"persona-employe","de":"mitarbeiter-persona","he":"פרסונה-עובדים","hi":"कर्मचारी-पर्सोना","id":"persona-karyawan","it":"persona-dipendente","ja":"従業員-ペルソナ","pt":"persona-funcionario","tr":"calisan-persona","vi":"persona-nhan-vien"}},"361":{"url":"werknemers-persona","head":"Wat Is een Werknemer Persona? Definitie, Voordelen en Toepassingen","enCategory":"HR Personas","parent":"59","lang":"nl","desc":"Werknemer personas vertegenwoordigen een groep werknemers die gemeenschappelijke kenmerken delen. Ze helpen je een positieve werkcultuur te creëren.","langNames":{"en":"English","ar":"Arabic","zh":"Chinese","nl":"Dutch","es":"Espanol","fr":"French","de":"German","he":"Hebrew","hi":"Hindi","id":"Indonesian","it":"Italian","ja":"Japanese","pt":"Portuguese","tr":"Turkish","vi":"Vietnamese"},"langUrls":{"en":"employee-personas","ar":"بيرسونا-الموظفين","zh":"员工-佩尔索纳","nl":"werknemers-persona","es":"persona-empleado","fr":"persona-employe","de":"mitarbeiter-persona","he":"פרסונה-עובדים","hi":"कर्मचारी-पर्सोना","id":"persona-karyawan","it":"persona-dipendente","ja":"従業員-ペルソナ","pt":"persona-funcionario","tr":"calisan-persona","vi":"persona-nhan-vien"}},"362":{"url":"persona-empleado","head":"¿Qué Es una Persona de Empleado? Definición, Beneficios y Usos","enCategory":"HR P