","parent":"54","lang":"tr","desc":"CRM'niz, doğru alıcı personaları oluşturmak için kaynak görevi gören veriler içerir. Burada, CRM verilerinden personalar oluşturmak için gereken her şeye bakıyoruz.","langNames":{"en":"English","zh":"Chinese","nl":"Dutch","es":"Espanol","fr":"French","he":"Hebrew","id":"Indonesian","it":"Italian","ja":"Japanese","ko":"Korean","pt":"Portuguese","tr":"Turkish","vi":"Vietnamese","hi":"Hindi","de":"German"},"langUrls":{"en":"buyer-personas-crm-data","zh":"买家-角色-crm-数据","nl":"koper-personas-crm-gegevens","es":"personas-comprador-datos-crm","fr":"personas-acheteur-donnees-crm","he":"פרסונות-קונים-נתוני-crm","id":"persona-pembeli-data-crm","it":"personas-acquirenti-dati-crm","ja":"バイヤー-ペルソナ-crm-データ","ko":"구매자-페르소나-crm-데이터","pt":"personas-comprador-dados-crm","tr":"alıcı-personaları-crm-verileri","vi":"persona-nguoi-mua-du-lieu-crm","hi":"खरीदार-पर्सोना-crm-डेटा","de":"kaufer-personas-crm-daten"}},"425":{"url":"persona-nguoi-mua-du-lieu-crm","head":"Cách Tạo Persona Người Mua từ Dữ Liệu CRM","enCategory":"Persona generation","parent":"54","lang":"vi","desc":"CRM của bạn chứa dữ liệu đóng vai trò như nguồn để tạo persona người mua chính xác. Ở đây, chúng tôi xem xét mọi thứ cần thiết để tạo persona từ dữ liệu CRM.","langNames":{"en":"English","zh":"Chinese","nl":"Dutch","es":"Espanol","fr":"French","he":"Hebrew","id":"Indonesian","it":"Italian","ja":"Japanese","ko":"Korean","pt":"Portuguese","tr":"Turkish","vi":"Vietnamese","hi":"Hindi","de":"German"},"langUrls":{"en":"buyer-personas-crm-data","zh":"买家-角色-crm-数据","nl":"koper-personas-crm-gegevens","es":"personas-comprador-datos-crm","fr":"personas-acheteur-donnees-crm","he":"פרסונות-קונים-נתוני-crm","id":"persona-pembeli-data-crm","it":"personas-acquirenti-dati-crm","ja":"バイヤー-ペルソナ-crm-データ","ko":"구매자-페르소나-crm-데이터","pt":"personas-comprador-dados-crm","tr":"alıcı-personaları-crm-verileri","vi":"persona-nguoi-mua-du-lieu-crm","hi":"खरीदार-पर्सोना-crm-डेटा","de":"kaufer-personas-crm-daten"}},"426":{"url":"खरीदार-पर्सोना-crm-डेटा","head":"CRM डेटा से खरीदार पर्सोना कैसे बनाएं","enCategory":"Persona generation","parent":"54","lang":"hi","desc":"आपके CRM में ऐसा डेटा होता है जो सटीक खरीदार पर्सोना बनाने के लिए स्रोत के रूप में कार्य करता है। यहां, हम CRM डेटा से पर्सोना बनाने के लिए आवश्यक सभी चीजों पर नज़र डालते हैं।","langNames":{"en":"English","zh":"Chinese","nl":"Dutch","es":"Espanol","fr":"French","he":"Hebrew","id":"Indonesian","it":"Italian","ja":"Japanese","ko":"Korean","pt":"Portuguese","tr":"Turkish","vi":"Vietnamese","hi":"Hindi","de":"German"},"langUrls":{"en":"buyer-personas-crm-data","zh":"买家-角色-crm-数据","nl":"koper-personas-crm-gegevens","es":"personas-comprador-datos-crm","fr":"personas-acheteur-donnees-crm","he":"פרסונות-קונים-נתוני-crm","id":"persona-pembeli-data-crm","it":"personas-acquirenti-dati-crm","ja":"バイヤー-ペルソナ-crm-データ","ko":"구매자-페르소나-crm-데이터","pt":"personas-comprador-dados-crm","tr":"alıcı-personaları-crm-verileri","vi":"persona-nguoi-mua-du-lieu-crm","hi":"खरीदार-पर्सोना-crm-डेटा","de":"kaufer-personas-crm-daten"}},"427":{"url":"kaufer-personas-crm-daten","head":"Wie man Käufer-Personas aus CRM-Daten erstellt","enCategory":"Persona generation","parent":"54","lang":"de","desc":"Ihr CRM enthält Daten, die als Quelle für die Erstellung genauer Käufer-Personas dienen. Hier betrachten wir alles, was erforderlich ist, um Personas aus CRM-Daten zu erstellen.","langNames":{"en":"English","zh":"Chinese","nl":"Dutch","es":"Espanol","fr":"French","he":"Hebrew","id":"Indonesian","it":"Italian","ja":"Japanese","ko":"Korean","pt":"Portuguese","tr":"Turkish","vi":"Vietnamese","hi":"Hindi","de":"German"},"langUrls":{"en":"buyer-personas-crm-data","zh":"买家-角色-crm-数据","nl":"koper-personas-crm-gegevens","es":"personas-comprador-datos-crm","fr":"personas-acheteur-donnees-crm","he":"פרסונות-קונים-נתוני-crm","id":"persona-pembeli-data-crm","it":"personas-acquirenti-dati-crm","ja":"バイヤー-ペルソナ-crm-データ","ko":"구매자-페르소나-crm-데이터","pt":"personas-comprador-dado