"pt":"perfil-de-cliente-ideal","tr":"ideal-musteri-profili","vi":"ho-so-khach-hang-ly-tuong","hi":"आदर्श-ग्राहक-प्रोफाइल","de":"ideales-kundenprofil"}},"437":{"url":"ho-so-khach-hang-ly-tuong","head":"Hồ Sơ Khách Hàng Lý Tưởng Là Gì?","enCategory":"Ideal customer profile","parent":"2","lang":"vi","desc":"Hồ Sơ Khách Hàng Lý Tưởng mô tả người sẽ được hưởng lợi từ những gì bạn cung cấp và đem lại giá trị cho bạn. HSKH giúp bạn có những cuộc trò chuyện ý nghĩa và chiến dịch tuyệt vời.","langNames":{"en":"English","nl":"Dutch","fr":"French","he":"Hebrew","id":"Indonesian","it":"Italian","ja":"Japanese","ko":"Korean","pt":"Portuguese","tr":"Turkish","vi":"Vietnamese","hi":"Hindi","de":"German"},"langUrls":{"en":"ideal-customer-profile","nl":"ideaal-klantprofiel","fr":"profil-client-ideal","he":"פרופיל-לקוח-אידיאלי","id":"profil-pelanggan-ideal","it":"profilo-cliente-ideale","ja":"理想的な-顧客-プロファイル","ko":"이상적인-고객-프로필","pt":"perfil-de-cliente-ideal","tr":"ideal-musteri-profili","vi":"ho-so-khach-hang-ly-tuong","hi":"आदर्श-ग्राहक-प्रोफाइल","de":"ideales-kundenprofil"}},"438":{"url":"आदर्श-ग्राहक-प्रोफाइल","head":"आदर्श ग्राहक प्रोफ़ाइल क्या है?","enCategory":"Ideal customer profile","parent":"2","lang":"hi","desc":"आदर्श ग्राहक प्रोफ़ाइल उस व्यक्ति का वर्णन करता है जो आपके प्रस्ताव से लाभान्वित होगा और बदले में आपको मूल्य देगा। ICP आपको सार्थक बातचीत और शानदार अभियानों में मदद करता है।","langNames":{"en":"English","nl":"Dutch","fr":"French","he":"Hebrew","id":"Indonesian","it":"Italian","ja":"Japanese","ko":"Korean","pt":"Portuguese","tr":"Turkish","vi":"Vietnamese","hi":"Hindi","de":"German"},"langUrls":{"en":"ideal-customer-profile","nl":"ideaal-klantprofiel","fr":"profil-client-ideal","he":"פרופיל-לקוח-אידיאלי","id":"profil-pelanggan-ideal","it":"profilo-cliente-ideale","ja":"理想的な-顧客-プロファイル","ko":"이상적인-고객-프로필","pt":"perfil-de-cliente-ideal","tr":"ideal-musteri-profili","vi":"ho-so-khach-hang-ly-tuong","hi":"आदर्श-ग्राहक-प्रोफाइल","de":"ideales-kundenprofil"}},"439":{"url":"ideales-kundenprofil","head":"Was Ist ein Ideales Kundenprofil?","enCategory":"Ideal customer profile","parent":"2","lang":"de","desc":"Das Ideale Kundenprofil beschreibt jemanden, der von Ihrem Angebot profitieren würde und Ihnen im Gegenzug einen Wert bietet. IKP hilft Ihnen bei bedeutungsvollen Gesprächen und großartigen Kampagnen.","langNames":{"en":"English","nl":"Dutch","fr":"French","he":"Hebrew","id":"Indonesian","it":"Italian","ja":"Japanese","ko":"Korean","pt":"Portuguese","tr":"Turkish","vi":"Vietnamese","hi":"Hindi","de":"German"},"langUrls":{"en":"ideal-customer-profile","nl":"ideaal-klantprofiel","fr":"profil-client-ideal","he":"פרופיל-לקוח-אידיאלי","id":"profil-pelanggan-ideal","it":"profilo-cliente-ideale","ja":"理想的な-顧客-プロファイル","ko":"이상적인-고객-프로필","pt":"perfil-de-cliente-ideal","tr":"ideal-musteri-profili","vi":"ho-so-khach-hang-ly-tuong","hi":"आदर्श-ग्राहक-प्रोफाइल","de":"ideales-kundenprofil"}},"440":{"url":"geographic-segmentation","blogImg":"/blog/geographic-segmentation-sq.jpg","alt":"A Guide to Geographic Segmentation in Marketing","blogHead":"A Guide to Geographic Segmentation in Marketing","head":"Geographic Segmentation in Marketing","desc":"Learn how to use geographic segmentation in marketing to provide highly customized and region-specific products and services that drive up sales and ROI.","category":"Marketing segmentation","readTime":13,"related":[18,19,20],"meta":{"title":"A Guide to Geographic Segmentation in Marketing","img":"/blog/geographic-segmentation-sq.jpg"},"img":"/blog/roll/geographic-segmentation.jpg","mailImg":"/blog/mail/geographic-segmentation.jpg"},"441":{"url":"如何创建推特角色","head":"如何创建推特角色","enCategory":"Social audience research;Persona generation","parent":"37","lang":"zh","desc":"推特是洞察受众的绝佳来源，无论是B2B还是B2C。开发你的推特角色并用于改善定位、消息传递和销售。","langNames":{"en":"English","zh":"Chinese","nl":"Dutch","es":"Espanol","fr":"French","id":"Indonesian","it":"Italian","pt":"Portuguese","vi":"Vietnamese","hi":"Hindi","de":"German"},"langUrls":