Persona Twitter","enCategory":"Social audience research;Persona generation","parent":"37","lang":"vi","desc":"Twitter là nguồn tuyệt vời cho những hiểu biết về khán giả, cả B2B và B2C. Phát triển persona Twitter của bạn và sử dụng chúng để nhắm mục tiêu, nhắn tin và bán hàng tốt hơn.","langNames":{"en":"English","zh":"Chinese","nl":"Dutch","es":"Espanol","fr":"French","id":"Indonesian","it":"Italian","pt":"Portuguese","vi":"Vietnamese","hi":"Hindi","de":"German"},"langUrls":{"en":"twitter-personas","zh":"如何创建推特角色","nl":"hoe-je-twitter-personas-creert","es":"como-crear-personas-de-twitter","fr":"comment-creer-des-personas-twitter","id":"cara-membuat-persona-twitter","it":"come-creare-persona-di-twitter","pt":"como-criar-personas-do-twitter","vi":"cach-tao-persona-twitter","hi":"ट्विटर-पर्सोना-कैसे-बनाए","de":"wie-man-twitter-personas-erstellt"}},"449":{"url":"ट्विटर-पर्सोना-कैसे-बनाए","head":"ट्विटर पर्सोना कैसे बनाएं","enCategory":"Social audience research;Persona generation","parent":"37","lang":"hi","desc":"ट्विटर दर्शकों के अंतर्दृष्टि के लिए एक बेहतरीन स्रोत है, B2B और B2C दोनों के लिए। अपने ट्विटर पर्सोना विकसित करें और उन्हें बेहतर लक्ष्यीकरण, संदेश और बिक्री के लिए उपयोग करें।","langNames":{"en":"English","zh":"Chinese","nl":"Dutch","es":"Espanol","fr":"French","id":"Indonesian","it":"Italian","pt":"Portuguese","vi":"Vietnamese","hi":"Hindi","de":"German"},"langUrls":{"en":"twitter-personas","zh":"如何创建推特角色","nl":"hoe-je-twitter-personas-creert","es":"como-crear-personas-de-twitter","fr":"comment-creer-des-personas-twitter","id":"cara-membuat-persona-twitter","it":"come-creare-persona-di-twitter","pt":"como-criar-personas-do-twitter","vi":"cach-tao-persona-twitter","hi":"ट्विटर-पर्सोना-कैसे-बनाए","de":"wie-man-twitter-personas-erstellt"}},"450":{"url":"wie-man-twitter-personas-erstellt","head":"Wie man Twitter Personas erstellt","enCategory":"Social audience research;Persona generation","parent":"37","lang":"de","desc":"Twitter ist eine großartige Quelle für Zielgruppeneinblicke, sowohl B2B als auch B2C. Entwickeln Sie Ihre Twitter Personas und nutzen Sie sie für besseres Targeting, Messaging und Verkauf.","langNames":{"en":"English","zh":"Chinese","nl":"Dutch","es":"Espanol","fr":"French","id":"Indonesian","it":"Italian","pt":"Portuguese","vi":"Vietnamese","hi":"Hindi","de":"German"},"langUrls":{"en":"twitter-personas","zh":"如何创建推特角色","nl":"hoe-je-twitter-personas-creert","es":"como-crear-personas-de-twitter","fr":"comment-creer-des-personas-twitter","id":"cara-membuat-persona-twitter","it":"come-creare-persona-di-twitter","pt":"como-criar-personas-do-twitter","vi":"cach-tao-persona-twitter","hi":"ट्विटर-पर्सोना-कैसे-बनाए","de":"wie-man-twitter-personas-erstellt"}},"451":{"url":"بيرسونا-seo-زيادة-أداء-البحث","head":"كيفية استخدام بيرسونا SEO لزيادة أداء البحث","enCategory":"Persona use-cases","parent":"50","lang":"ar","desc":"تعلم كيفية إنشاء واستخدام بيرسونا SEO للحصول على رؤية وأداء البحث العضوي. استخدم بيرسونا البحث لتحسين استراتيجية SEO والعثور على الكلمات الرئيسية والتواصل مع الجمهور المناسب.","langNames":{"en":"English","ar":"Arabic","zh":"Chinese","es":"Espanol","fr":"French","id":"Indonesian","it":"Italian","ja":"Japanese","pt":"Portuguese","tr":"Turkish","vi":"Vietnamese","hi":"Hindi","de":"German"},"langUrls":{"en":"seo-persona-search-performance","ar":"بيرسونا-seo-زيادة-أداء-البحث","zh":"seo-角色画像-提高-搜索-表现","es":"persona-seo-mejorar-rendimiento-busqueda","fr":"persona-seo-ameliorer-performances-recherche","id":"seo-persona-meningkatkan-performa-pencarian","it":"persona-seo-migliorare-prestazioni-ricerca","ja":"seo-ペルソナ-検索-パフォーマンス-向上","pt":"persona-seo-aumentar-desempenho-busca","tr":"seo-persona-arama-performansini-artirma","vi":"seo-persona-tang-hieu-suat-tim-kiem","hi":"seo-पर्सोना-खोज-प्रदर्शन-बढ़ाना","de":"seo-persona-suchleistung-steigern"}},"452":{"url":"seo-角色画像-提高-搜索-表现","head":"如何使用 SEO 角色画像提高搜索表现","enCategory":"Persona use-cases","parent":"50","lang":"zh","desc":"学习如何创建和使用 SEO 角色画像来获得有机搜索可见度和表现。使用搜索角