 in marketing. Learn how AI can transform consumer research, content creation, sales, marketing, and product development strategies.","colorId":"5"},"social-audience-research":{"txt":"It’s getting harder to keep up with the demands of your social media audience. Learn how to understand your users and leverage data-driven insights for better social media marketing.","colorId":"3"},"competitor-analysis":{"txt":"Analyzing competitors is key to staying ahead of the curve. Learn how to conduct competitor analysis to build a unique product positioning and brand reputation.","colorId":"1"},"b2b-personas":{"txt":"B2B clients are widely different from B2C prospects. Understand the challenges, opportunities, and purchasing decisions associated with these buyers with B2B personas.","colorId":"0"},"marketing-ideas":{"txt":"Spark creativity with innovative marketing ideas. Discover new approaches to engaging your audience, boosting brand engagement, and driving conversions.","colorId":"2"},"hr-personas":{"txt":"It's new, but HR personas can greatly simplify the talent acquisition and management process. Learn how to create personas to attract and retain the top talent for your company.","colorId":"3"},"how-to's":{"txt":"Our practical guides and step-by-step tutorials will help you out on various marketing topics. Leverage these insights for growth and business success.","colorId":"4"},"customer-journeys":{"txt":"Keep your ideal customers coming back for more. Discover strategies and actionable tips to boost retention, reduce churn, and maximize the customer lifetime value.","colorId":"2"},"voice-of-the-customer":{"txt":"Listen to the true voice of your customers. Learn how to gather, analyze, and act on customer feedback to build stronger relationships and improve your services.","colorId":"1"},"e-commerce-personas":{"colorId":"5"},"personas-for-agencies":{"colorId":"4"},"buyer-persona-template":{"colorId":"5"},"live-persona":{"colorId":"0"},"competitor-persona":{"colorId":"1"},